based on Articles 40, 54 paragraph 1 and 69 paragraph 2 of the Federal Constitution (Cst.), having considered the report of the Council of States Political Institutions Committee of 27 January 2014, and the opinion of the Federal Council of 7 March 2014,
decrees:
